### The layout's instance type

A layout belongs to exactly one instance type, and the data source returns it as
`instance_type` (`id`, `name`, `code`). Taking both `layout_id` and `instance_type_id`
from the one lookup keeps an instance from pairing a layout with the wrong type, and
spares a second lookup by name.

